{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43145","headline":"谢僧寄拄杖 · 谢邈","name":"谢僧寄拄杖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"峭壁猨啼采处深，一枝奇异出孤岑。\n感师千里寄来意，发我片云归去心。\n窗外冷敲檐冻折，溪边闲点戏鱼沉。\n他年必藉相携力，蹇步犹能返故林。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"谢邈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43145.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43145","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}